DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18140::$$$message_0138_0000_0000$$$::Right, let's go to the ruins in the forest![lr]::
18141::$$$message_0138_0000_0001$$$::I have an awful, hopeless feeling about this, but there might be an exciting encounter waiting for us there...!::
18142::$$$message_0138_0001_0000$$$::"(cough cough) ...I-I can't believe she blew herself up... Damn you, Gym Shorts. You're one hell of a (wo)man.[lr]::
18143::$$$message_0138_0001_0001$$$::...Ahhh, here lies the death of Taiga's dream."[lr]::
18144::$$$message_0138_0001_0002$$$::See?[lr]::
18145::$$$message_0138_0001_0003$$$::It's completely ruined the moment, but she's still here on our boring side of the world.::
18146::$$$message_0138_0002_0000$$$::"But I digress.[lr]::
18147::$$$message_0138_0002_0001$$$::Well met, young one.[lr]::
18148::$$$message_0138_0002_0002$$$::Is it what I think? Are you here to see someone stronger than me?"::
18149::$$$message_0138_0003_0000$$$::"I've had just about enough of this bloody business.[lr]::
18150::$$$message_0138_0003_0001$$$::...Aren't you that sergeant from earlier?"[lr]::
18151::$$$message_0138_0003_0002$$$::"That's a hard no![lr]::
18152::$$$message_0138_0003_0003$$$::I'm the Quiz Fiend! The legendary Quiz Fiend who lives here in Kuide Pass!"::
18153::$$$message_0138_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18154::$$$message_0138_0004_0001$$$::This is getting out of hand.[lr]::
18155::$$$message_0138_0004_0002$$$::Does it all stem from the disaster with Tohsaka's Jeweled Sword?[lr]::
18156::$$$message_0138_0004_0003$$$::Something even worse than radiation might be pouring out of the Einzbern Forest.::
18157::$$$message_0138_0005_0000$$$::"You there! Stop looking so fed up with life![lr]::
18158::$$$message_0138_0005_0001$$$::When in Rome, do as Romans do! Now that you're here, you have to play with me![lr]::
18159::$$$message_0138_0005_0002$$$::Of course, I'm not asking you to do it for free. If you answer everything correctly, there will be prizes that'll make your daily life easier![lr]::
18160::$$$message_0138_0005_0003$$$::I've got loads of prizes in stock, like washing machines that make delicious rice with the push of a button, washing machines that clean all your dishes with the push of a button, and washing machines you can play the latest video games on!"::
18161::$$$message_0138_0006_0000$$$::"I don't believe you."[lr]::
18162::$$$message_0138_0006_0001$$$::Also, do not want.[lr]::
18163::$$$message_0138_0006_0002$$$::"Heh. Excellent spinal reflexes. I sure know how to pick 'em.[lr]::
18164::$$$message_0138_0006_0003$$$::Allllrighty, it's time to kill each other![lr]::
18165::$$$message_0138_0006_0004$$$::This is a test of luck[line len=2]either you'll survive or I'll eat you all!"[lr]::
18166::$$$message_0138_0006_0005$$$::She ain't listening.::
18167::$$$message_0138_0007_0000$$$::"The Quiz Dojo is now open.[lr]::
18168::$$$message_0138_0007_0001$$$::There are two genres. Don't worry, the prizes won't change no matter which one you choose.[lr]::
18169::$$$message_0138_0007_0002$$$::Go ahead and pick what you want!"::
918142::$$$message_9138_0001_0000$$$::"(cough cough) ...I-I can't believe she blew herself up... Damn you, Gym Shorts. You're one hell of a (wo)man."[r]:i[